# Getting Ready for the Curriculum

<img src="https://images.code.org/11d7634b4267f4aa8afc6a3caa340a9b-MS17.png" alt="Insert alt text here" style="width: 35%; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 10px 10px; float: right;">

This professional learning module is designed to give you a **guided introductio** to the core concepts, tools, and instructional approaches used throughout Unit 1.

Think of this module as an opportunity to **build familiarity** with the learning experience students will encounter while exploring web design and AI-supported development. 

While this module highlights important ideas and teaching strategies, it is not intended to cover every lesson or concept in depth. 

We still recommend reviewing individual lessons and lesson materials before teaching them with students.

<br>

## This Module Covers:

<div style="width: 100%; margin: 25px 0px;">

  <!-- Top Row -->
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">

<div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 30%; min-height: 180px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); box-sizing: border-box;">
      <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">👥 User-Centered Design</p>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0;">
        Explore how designers create digital experiences that meet the needs of real users.
      </p>
    </div>

<div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 30%; min-height: 180px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); box-sizing: border-box;">
      <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">🤖 HTML with AI</p>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0;">
        Learn how AI can support building and structuring webpages with HTML.
      </p>
    </div>

<div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 30%; min-height: 180px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); box-sizing: border-box;">
      <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">🎨 CSS with AI</p>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0;">
        Discover how AI tools can help style and customize webpages using CSS.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Row -->
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px;">

<div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 30%; min-height: 180px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); box-sizing: border-box;">
      <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">🖊️ Wireframes & Web Design</p>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0;">
        Practice planning layouts and organizing content before building webpages.
      </p>
    </div>

<div style="background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 30%; min-height: 180px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); box-sizing: border-box;">
      <p style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">💡 AI-Supported Pedagogy</p>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0;">
        Explore instructional strategies for helping students effectively prompt AI, evaluate responses, and use AI tools responsibly during the design process.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

--- 

As you move through the module, focus on building confidence with the concepts, noticing instructional strategies, and making connections to how students may experience the learning in your classroom.
